    '```\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Autoscaling\n' +
    '\n' +
    'Endpoints use **compute units (CU)** (~2 GB RAM per CU). Range: 0.5--32 CU (dynamic), 36--112 CU (fixed). Scale-to-zero enabled by default (5 min timeout).\n' +
    '\n' +
    'See [computes-and-scaling.md](references/computes-and-scaling.md) for sizing tables, endpoint CRUD, and configuration details.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '## Branches\n' +
    '\n' +
